    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e23883ec06a163c5a9e0760f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从现在起，就是她在闪耀系列赛生涯的开始。\n所有的结果都会作为官方记录留存\n……无法修改。",
      "source_fingerprint": "962bce742816db47b32e5ba2e918035554004b5554ad0ba7fd193027f52f71ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41e5bdb3b7e7cd3d55619ed7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅仅一次的败战就会影响她的今后……\n甚至连未来的评价都会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7b8e12da72b2e92d06cc4055cbf70aac974984147a0d494f3b5feb45c02cc8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
